✗ FAIL: Particles at exact centroids should be found in correct elements!

This confirms the hypothesis:
  Elements are assigned to octree leaves based on their CENTROIDS,
  but particles (even at exact centroids) navigate to different leaves!

ROOT CAUSE:
  An element may EXTEND into multiple octants, but is only stored in
  ONE octant (based on centroid). Particles inside the element but in
  different octants won't find it.

